      "evidence": [
        {
          "id": "S5E4",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "\"For 18 to 34-year-olds, it's over 70% who admit to doing this regularly,\" says Daniel Monaghan, a researcher at Ampere Analysis."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E12",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "\"Over half of 35 to 44s admit to doing it, and about a third of those aged 45 to 64.\""
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E8",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "In August, a man in Lancashire was jailed for six and a half years for running an illegal streaming service that police said had generated"
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E9",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "almost £1m in illicit profits."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E18",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "This year's Champions League final went behind a paywall in the UK for the first time in more than 30 years."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E24",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "Viewers were asked to pay at least £4.99 to watch it, prompting a backlash, including from the then-prime minister, Arsenal fan Sir Keir Starmer."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E5",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "\"What it comes down to is the financial side - that's the big one - and ease of access as well,\" he says."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E19",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "Meanwhile the streams he uses are free, with links readily obtainable on social media."
        },
        {
          "id": "S5E20",
          "sourceId": "83e821571c436a96",
          "quote": "These links, used by Kiran and his friends, have practical downsides – such as frequent buffering or poor quality, or platforms that disappear without warning."
